{"id":"poddelka","lemma":"подделка","pos":"noun","rank":2877,"glosses":["counterfeit, imitation; fake; forgery"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"подделки","plural":"подделки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это была подделка.","en":"It was a fake.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Откуда ты знаешь, что это подделка?","en":"How do you know this is a fake?","words":[{"g":"whence, from where"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Я думал, это подделка.","en":"I thought it was fake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"С чего ты взял, что это подделка?","en":"What makes you think it's a fake?","words":[{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"what for? why?"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"why"]]},{"text":"Я почти уверен, что это не подделка.","en":"I'm pretty sure that this isn't a fake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"almost, nearly"},null,null,null,{"g":"not"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]}]}